    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d428">

                <pb facs="0533" n="1287" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp02v02/pg1287"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72111/7349</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Shea</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-10-10T17:00:00-04:42">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 10, 1917, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 7.10 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your cipher telegram of October 9, 3 p.m., my cipher telegram May 28, 6 p.m., my
                    despatch No. 134, May 29.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d428-f1"/> I have received
                    memorandum from the Foreign Office to the effect that merchant vessels armed for
                    their own defense will be treated in Chilean ports as merchant vessels provided
                    their Government previously notifies <pb facs="0534" n="1288" xml:id="pg1288"/>
                    Chilean Government of the name of the ship and provided that itinerary,
                    distribution, armament, absence of army or navy officers or men, passenger list
                    and merchandise make the ship appear to really be a merchant vessel.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shea</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
